{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "id": "mt_dialog_priest",
  "_doc": "迷烟镇金记铺掌柜。P2 协议归一(2026-09-04)：choices→options(带 jump_id 跳转行)、speaker→speaker_id；effects 为行内命令，选择选项时由 DialogueEventExecutor.apply_inline 执行。",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "speaker_id": "mt_npc_priest",
      "text": "施主带了玉簪来，这便是金记铺那位姑娘交代的了。只是镇外野狼又闹将起来，还望施主代为驱逐。",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "包在我身上。",
          "jump_id": "opt_accept",
          "effects": ["quest_accept:mt_quest_deliver", "set_flag:mt_flag_accepted"]
        },
        {
          "text": "容我先想想。",
          "jump_id": "opt_think",
          "effects": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "opt_accept",
      "speaker_id": "mt_npc_priest",
      "text": "好胆魄！野狼多在镇外古庙附近出没，施主带了兵刃去，万事小心。",
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "opt_think",
      "speaker_id": "mt_npc_priest",
      "text": "不急不急，施主想好了再来寻老朽便是。玉簪先押在柜上，分文不少。",
      "effects": []
    }
  ]
}
